[[Open This|4.1.1 Request Headers]]

---

https://rfd.shared.oxide.computer/rfd/0538#_request_headers

Webhook delivery requests always include the following headers:

Request Headers

|Name|Value|h
| content-type|application/json|
|x-oxide-delivery-id|A UUID that uniquely identifies this delivery attempt for the event.|
|x-oxide-webhook-id|The UUID that identifies the webhook receiver to which the event was delivered.|
|x-oxide-event-class|The event class string of the event.|
|x-oxide-event-id|The event UUID of the event.|
|x-oxide-signature|A HMAC signature of the payload for each H each secret key assigned to this webhook receiver. See the next section for details on the format of this header.|